# Applies to the build context at the repository root (docker build -f services/agent-service/Dockerfile ... .).
# Everything is excluded, then only what the image needs is let back in: the tool contracts and the redaction rules are
# read at runtime (P4.3); no .env, no keys, no tests, no other service.
*
!contracts/redaction-rules.yaml
!contracts/openapi
!contracts/openapi/**
!contracts/schemas
!contracts/schemas/**
!services/agent-service/requirements.txt
!services/agent-service/config
!services/agent-service/config/**
!services/agent-service/migrations
!services/agent-service/migrations/**
!services/agent-service/src
!services/agent-service/src/**
**/__pycache__
